{
  "encoding": "ld(parts) = for each part: 8-byte big-endian UTF-8 byte length + UTF-8 bytes; digest = lowercase hex SHA-256 (app.common.encoding convention). Consumer and route ids are the frozen I1 formulas (i1-vectors/ids.json V01, V03).",
  "vectors": [
